.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sentinel-completions 1  "completions " 
.SH NAME
sentinel\-completions \- Print the shell completion script for `<shell>` to stdout
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsentinel\-completions\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISHELL\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the shell completion script for `<shell>` to stdout.
.PP
A pure side command: no discovery, no scan, no network, no cache, so it works outside a Git repository.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISHELL\fR>
Shell to generate the completion script for
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
bash
.IP \(bu 2
elvish
.IP \(bu 2
fish
.IP \(bu 2
powershell
.IP \(bu 2
zsh
.RE
